    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tlz8](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tlz8) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 556.753 depth occurred on Aug 19 2026 22km SE of Tuvuca. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -17.8049 longitude -178.6638. It impacted 943 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
